Subject: [BENCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: add Cubie A5E big-cluster OPP candidates

Use only the Radxa A5E BSP A523-family VF points whose voltage is
identical and nonzero in all eleven bins. This does not add a voltage
for the stock nominal 768 MHz U-Boot handoff. Keep cpu0-3 and the shared
little-CPU/DSU rail untouched.

Board supply evidence: radxa/allwinner-device a23224f1c1764,
configs/cubie_a5e/linux-5.15/board.dts (CPU4 external DCDC1).
Operating-point evidence: radxa/allwinner-bsp 2045a3ca2a01,
configs/linux-5.15/sun55iw3p1.dtsi (cluster1_opp_table).
In the mainline A5E DTS external DCDC1 is reg_dcdc1_323.

Separate research build only. Activation is guarded in the CPUFreq
driver; an unlisted boot rate must not cause an automatic transition.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun55i-a527-cubie-a5e.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun55i-a527-cubie-a5e.dts
@@ -198,6 +198,52 @@
 	rx-internal-delay-ps = <400>;
 
 	status = "okay";
+};
+
+/ {
+	/* Radxa BSP OPPs common to all eleven VF bins, cluster 1 only. */
+	a5e_big_opp_table: opp-table-big {
+		compatible = "operating-points-v2";
+		opp-shared;
+
+		opp-408000000 {
+			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <408000000>;
+			opp-microvolt = <900000>;
+			clock-latency-ns = <244144>;
+		};
+
+		opp-1488000000 {
+			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <1488000000>;
+			opp-microvolt = <1000000>;
+			clock-latency-ns = <244144>;
+		};
+
+		opp-1584000000 {
+			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <1584000000>;
+			opp-microvolt = <1050000>;
+			clock-latency-ns = <244144>;
+		};
+	};
+};
+
+&cpu4 {
+	cpu-supply = <&reg_dcdc1_323>;
+	operating-points-v2 = <&a5e_big_opp_table>;
+};
+
+&cpu5 {
+	cpu-supply = <&reg_dcdc1_323>;
+	operating-points-v2 = <&a5e_big_opp_table>;
+};
+
+&cpu6 {
+	cpu-supply = <&reg_dcdc1_323>;
+	operating-points-v2 = <&a5e_big_opp_table>;
+};
+
+&cpu7 {
+	cpu-supply = <&reg_dcdc1_323>;
+	operating-points-v2 = <&a5e_big_opp_table>;
 };
 
 &gpu {
